><div class="core__group--body ecom-accordion__body"><div class="core__blocks" index="2"><div class="core__blocks--body"><div class="ecom-block ecom-core core__block ecom-qbh7mgpg8xr" data-core-is="block"><div class="ecom__element ecom-element element__text" data-stopdrag="" deep="1"><div class="text-content ecom-html has-drop-cap-view-framed">{{ 'sections.ecom-66e44124800d90e40b0011a2-product.textcontent_qbh7mgpg8xr_html' | t }}</div></div></div> </div></div></div></div><div id="ecom-w1qwezmvl2" class="core__group--item ecom-accordion__item" data-id="ecom-w1qwezmvl2"><div class="ecom-accordion__title ecom-flex ecom-w__full ecom-al_center ecom-items" data-target="#undefined"><div class="ecom-accordion_nav--icon ecom-items--icon" style="order: 1;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 384 512" fill="currentColor"><path d="M360.5 217.5l-152 143.1C203.9 365.8 197.9 368 192 368s-11.88-2.188-16.5-6.562L23.5 217.5C13.87 208.3 13.47 193.1 22.56 183.5C31.69 173.8 46.94 173.5 56.5 182.6L192 310.9l135.5-128.4c9.562-9.094 24.75-8.75 33.94 .9375C370.5 193.1 370.1 208.3 360.5 217.5z"></path></svg></div><div class="ecom-accordion_nav--icon ecom-items--icon ecom-items-icon-active" style="order: 1;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 384 512" fill="currentColor"><path d="M23.5 294.5l152-143.1C180.1 146.2 186.1 144 192 144s11.88 2.188 16.5 6.562l152 143.1c9.625 9.125 10.03 24.31 .9375 33.93c-9.125 9.688-24.38 10.03-33.94 .9375l-135.5-128.4l-135.5 128.4c-9.562 9.094-24.75 8.75-33.94-.9375C13.47 318.9 13.87 303.7 23.5 294.5z"></path></svg></div><div class="ecom-accordion_wrapper-info ecom-flex ecom-al_center"><span class="ecom-items--icon ecom-accordion_icon-title" data-image="false"></span><h3 class="ecom-accordion__title-text ecom-items--text">{{ 'sections.ecom-66e44124800d90e40b0011a2-product.item_title_3_obyhwb3w3en_html' | t }}</h3></div></div><div class="core__group--body ecom-accordion__body"><div class="core__blocks" index="3"><div class="core__blocks--body"><div class="ecom-block ecom-core core__block ecom-6qwj9ootexe" data-core-is="block"><div class="ecom__element ecom-element element__text" data-stopdrag="" deep="1"><div class="text-content ecom-html has-drop-cap-view-framed">The Phoenix Gravity is one of the most advanced filtration systems on the market. With a Phoenix Gravity System, your water is purified through three-stages of activated carbon filtration to remove 99.9% of contaminants including bacteria, parasites, cysts, pesticides, heavy metals and more. Our highly dense filtration system uses the highest quality coconut shells (CTC 60) to create a tortuous path rated at &lt;1 micron. This means we can trap physical contaminants that are more than 20 times smaller than jug filters. Combined with our higher filtration contact time we are 20 times more powerful than typical jug filters and those using granular carbon.<div><br><div>Our stainless steel chambers not only prevent microplastics and other harmful chemicals from leaching into your water, but also hold significantly more purified water than the average jug. This makes it even easier for you to enjoy fresh, nutrient-rich hydration - whenever you need it most. Unlike Reverse Osmosis (RO) filters, the gravity system does not require electricity to run or a plumber to install - and it won’t strip your water of the healthy nutrients your body benefits from.</div></div></div></div></div> </div></div></div></div></div></div> </div></div> </div></div></div></div> </div><div class="ecom-section__overlay"><div class="ecom-overlay"></div></div> </section><section class="ecom-row ecom-core ecom-section ecom-mlj4lp8h05k" data-id="ecom-mlj4lp8h05k" style="z-index: inherit;"><div data-deep="1" class="core__row--columns"><div class="ecom-column ecom-core ecom-gv4z017lz2t"><div class="core__column--wrapper"><div class="ecom-column__overlay"><div class="ecom-overlay"></div></div><div class="core__blocks" index="0"><div class="core__blocks--body"><div cla