 "headingtext_0tufbot7z4ng_html": "Product Description",
 "textcontent_jixhtf0l2ag_html": "<ul><li>The Phoenix Gravity System is easy to set up for \nany countertop in your home or workplace, no \nplumber or electricity required.<\/li><li>Housed in 304-grade stainless steel, naturally \nBPA-free and non-leaching.<\/li><li>&nbsp;Activated carbon filters made out from the \nhighest grade coconut shells (CTC 60) and infused \nwith silver to remove 99.99% contaminants and \npreserve the nutrients your body needs.<\/li><\/ul>",
 "textcontent_t7bto3oqz4c_html": "<ul><li>20 x more powerful than a typical jug or those using granular carbon. Several times denser, with an extended filtration contact time and a &lt;1 micron rating they are 20 x more effective.<\/li><li>Fuses natural force of gravity with the highest-grade environmentally-friendly materials for the \nmost effective, sustainable and durable filtration on \nthe market.<\/li><\/ul>",
 "view_more_text_0odul5bqmpyh_html": "View more",
 "view_less_text_0odul5bqmpyh_html": "View less",
 "headingtext_dljtcmjjta5_html": "Designed for durability",
 "textcontent_fc6t1daofxp_html": " <ul><li>Unlike plastic filters, Phoenix Gravity\u2019s 304 \nstainless steel housing won\u2019t leach polyurethane, \nmicroplastics or harmful chemicals into your \nwater over time.<\/li><li>Rust-resistant to withstand the rigours of \neveryday use for 10+ years<\/li><li>The hand polishing is done with the highest attention to detail to ensure quality, rivaling that of car manufacturers.<br><\/li><\/ul>",
 "headingtext_hfqc1pkrjc5_html": "5-minute assembly",
 "textcontent_ma7fkal9sdg_html": " <ul><li>Install your Phoenix Gravity in 5 minutes or less.<\/li><li>It is easy to assemble.<br><\/li><li>No tools are required.<br><\/li><li>Just use your hands.<\/li><\/ul>",
 "headingtext_w2tm3b46v3_html": "5-minute assembly",
 "textcontent_c3scdabkhus_html": " <ul><li>Install your Phoenix Gravity in 5 minutes or less.<\/li><li>It is easy to assemble.<br><\/li><li>No tools are required.<br><\/li><li>Just use your hands.<\/li><\/ul>",
 "headingtext_092ut8r8lfby_html": "How smart carbon cartridges work? ",
 "textcontent_zfv0720mo5_html": " <ul><li>Our smart carbon cartridges rely on mechanical filtration method. The dense porous wall captures physical contaminants like microplastics, sediments, bacteria, cysts and other physical impurities. <\/li><li>By way of adsorption, chemical contaminants like chlorine, PFAS, pesticides, and many other chemical molecules get adhered to the surface of the activated carbon. <br><\/li><\/ul>",
 "textcontent_cu8aby1h5tk_html": " <ul><li>Our activated coconut carbon cartridges filter\nwater for all your drinking and cooking needs.<\/li><li>Designed for longevity- our\ncartridges last up to 12 months. <br><\/li><li>This means fewer replacements and lower cost\nper litre. <br><\/li><li>We use a touch of silver to prevent bacteria re-growth- one of the\nmost common problems with traditional filters.<br><\/li><\/ul>",
 "ecomiconlisttitle0_ecomteds68hedz_teds68hedz_html": "If you don\u2019t like your water filter within 100 days, we\u2019ll give you a full refund.",
